        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor U as Usuario\n    participant API as API FastAPI\n    participant DIS as DocumentIngestionService\n    participant DL as DocumentLoader\n    participant TC as TextCleaner\n    participant CS as ChunkingService\n    participant ES as EmbeddingService\n    participant VR as VectorRepository\n    participant SS as StorageService\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL/pgvector\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;API: POST /documents (archivo)\n    API-&gt;&gt;DIS: procesarDocumento(archivo)\n    DIS-&gt;&gt;SS: guardarOriginal(archivo)\n    SS--&gt;&gt;DIS: rutaOriginal\n    DIS-&gt;&gt;DL: extraerTexto(archivo)\n    DL--&gt;&gt;DIS: texto\n    DIS-&gt;&gt;TC: limpiar(texto)\n    TC--&gt;&gt;DIS: textoLimpio\n    DIS-&gt;&gt;CS: fragmentar(textoLimpio)\n    CS--&gt;&gt;DIS: chunks\n    loop por cada chunk\n        DIS-&gt;&gt;ES: generarEmbedding(chunk.contenido)\n        ES--&gt;&gt;DIS: embedding\n    end\n    DIS-&gt;&gt;VR: guardarChunks(chunks con embeddings)\n    VR-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT documento, chunks, embeddings\n    DB--&gt;&gt;VR: ok\n    VR--&gt;&gt;DIS: ok\n    DIS--&gt;&gt;API: documento listo\n    API--&gt;&gt;U: 201 Created&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="zkEEwns58qu7URqoD3_H-1">
